    "identity_tolerance": 0.95,
    "note": "LOOP-AND-INCREMENT training: all experts + MTP share the SAME teacher top-k over a fixed window of the first N tokens (not continuous forward streaming). TRAIN TILL IT WORKS: a tier only advances once the student CONVERGES on the window's teacher top-k (student\u2194teacher top-k overlap >= identity_tolerance) \u2014 this forces the model to actually learn each window before growing N. max_loops_per_tier is the escape hatch (advance anyway after that many loops) so an unlearnable window can't deadlock the run. Then increment N: 8, 9, ... until max_tokens (2000)."
